MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "A Very Special Christmas 2 feels like a natural follow-up to my latest Christmas compilation, while the Phil Spector collection connects that holiday interest with the older pop sound I enjoy.",
    "Best of Johnny Rivers fits my interest in mid-'60s hits, and Hipsters' Holiday connects my current Christmas mood with the vocal jazz appeal of Cheek to Cheek."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Big Hits of the 80's and Pure 80's Hits share the compilation format I often choose, but their era does not fit my current preference for holiday music and earlier classic hits.",
    "HERE gives me too little indication of a connection to those interests. One Wish fits the holiday theme, but that alone does not make it as appealing as the Christmas collections with a stronger connection to my listening."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in greatest-hits collections seems to have been treated as interest in hits from any decade, when the particular era and sound matter to me.",
    "My recent Christmas listening seems to suggest that any holiday album will appeal equally, but I still care about the performers and musical style."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My latest Christmas listening matters more to what I want today than my older, broader pop interests.",
    "Familiar older pop and vocal styles strengthen a holiday recommendation for me; an unfamiliar compilation such as Be My Baby still needs a track-list check before I would choose it."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations understood my holiday mood and affection for older hits, but sometimes stretched those interests into any Christmas album or any hits compilation."
}
